-- Door Guides: playbook rows for step 1 (built) and the survey-model change (Sean, 2026-11-03, wrap-up sweep). Data only, safe to run twice.
-- Canon canon-ve-door-guides stays at v1 until Sean signs off the change.
insert into public.playbook_records (slug, brand_slug, author, body, source, kind)
select v.slug, 'vegans-explore', 'Logan', v.body, 'text', 'decision'
from (values
 ('ve-door-guides', $q$BUILT 2026-11-03 (Sean: "Go ahead and deploy, then send me the diff afterward"; migration 20261103_door_guides.sql; ve-taster, ve-guide-unlock, ve-events-guide from 7497a6c; ve-nurture from 4ec38d8): the Vegan Events Guide free with an email (guide_join, a Taster key opens its screens), recording needs an approved event claim or an active membership with 18+ ticked and 90 seconds an answer, ve_door_guide_stats(), and the Day 3 and Day 7 welcome notes in draft and off (both tested to contact@lesaruss.com). Proven live and the test row removed. Not proven: a claimed host's recording going through, a real send.$q$),
 ('ve-door-guides', $q$DIRECTION CHANGE 2026-11-03 (Sean, after the build; canon v1 not edited yet): everyone gets a free account but must complete the survey tied to the Guide; the Guide is free to share, walks them through claiming their profile and tees up the opportunities; the way through is the one-time $11 or the Guide's survey; a paying member can still take the survey for points. For events, everyone takes the event survey first; completing it admits a non-member and puts a sponsorship applicant in the running; sponsorships are reviewed competitively, never an entitlement. Supersedes the email-only reader. Open for Sean: event survey points (default 100), and whether the general survey admits without the event survey (default yes, sponsorship still needs the event survey).$q$),
 ('ve-door-guides', $q$NEXT 2026-11-03: Sean's two answers, canon v2, a survey per Guide as rows on the survey door engine, the Events Guide gate and claim-your-profile step, sponsorship review view in Depot, reword the welcome notes for members. Detail in docs/handoff/2026-11-03-door-guides.md.$q$)
) as v(slug, body)
where not exists (select 1 from public.playbook_records p where p.slug = v.slug and p.body = v.body);
